Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 14:00:23 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 46/53] Guide: Select Music (minimediaplayer.xex) for a hard
 drive without music

hud action 5 (91447EA8) loads minimediaplayer.xex; its full-width scenes are pages of the Personal Settings framework (make_music_assets.py, music.txt), entered HalfToFull with trans_FadeOut / trans_FadeIn between them. Music Sources: XMPGetMediaSources (0x7002B, xam 81A410F8) lists sources in state 4, and the hard drive's slot (81A47198) is in state 4 whenever XboxHardwareInfo reports a hard disk, so one row, Hard Drive; LegendY Play All Music on a source row, LegendX Return Control to Game. Music Library: Play All and the five categories (two columns, NavLeft / NavRight). The categories with nothing found (901051F8): list hidden, Play All disabled, No ... found., LegendY cleared. Play All / Y: BeginPlayback finds no songs and the app unloads at its first 50 ms timer (90108A60), back to hud's menu on Select Music (FullToHalf). X (Return Control to Game / Xbox Guide) and B on the first scene unload the app too.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>

Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01D8Y8uNNBmKZ7J6MZXNhzHq
